1. `s.substr(0,s.size()-2)` : taking substring of a string s from 0 to 
    leaving its last 2 characters .
    
    
2. `concatenating string` : s + 'i'  this will add 'i' character at 
    last of the string s.
    
    
3. `std::find` --> to find any number as if( std::find(s.begin(),s.end() ,target) != s.end()) 
    condition will  get true only if number if found in the s vector . != s.end() as if the target 
    is not found then our find will point at ending and if found then it will point on that
    particular position so != end().
    
